      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RELEASE POINT (3) flew the lids and led throughout to score a most impressive win by 7 lengths at this track over 320m (18.17). Form here is sound including five wins. Looks the testing material. MISS ARIZONA (1) goes very well at the distance with six wins and a placing from 13 starts. Missed the frame latest (22.91) when fifth over 400m at Maitland in a NG. Looks suited here and can measure up. MARKET MAVERICK (8) goes very well this course and distance starting four times for two wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (22.83) when sixth over 400m at Bulli in a Grade 4/5. Among the main chances. AUTUMN BOY (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
